				"size": "m",
				"w": 594.0880737304688,
				"text": "when we remove a contianer we lost the data\nthat that we have.\n===> To solve this issue and to have also a \n          persisted volumes or a persisted data\n          in case we restart or will remove the \n          container we want to keep this data \n          and we don't want to lose this data\n          we use docker volues.\n===> the conatiner has its own virtual file \n         system \n===> if we launch many containes we want to \n         mount them and we want to point\n         them to the same data \n===> Folder in physical file system (host) is \n          mounted into the virtual file ystem of\n          docker (container)",
				"font": "draw",
